    "Before you begin: what this playbook is—and is not\nThis playbook extracts the business-building lessons from the supplied founder story and turns them into an actionable guide. The central journey is:\n1. Stop jumping between business models and choose to build a durable product.\n2. Turn a small internal tool into a product customers will pay for.\n3. Launch an imperfect but usable first version to test demand.\n4. Improve the product based on what customers need.\n5. Experiment with pricing and recurring revenue.\n6. Make difficult ownership and team decisions.\n7. Rebuild the product around customer value when growth weakens.\n8. Track customer outcomes, build a capable team, and create a business that can operate without the founder doing everything.",
